WEBVTT

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:04.240
<i>A short while passed after that,</i>

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.650
<i>and I set foot in a whole new environment.</i>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.100
<i>By which I mean I started high school.</i>

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:44.540
Episode 18
"Superhuman Qualities"

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:45.320
<i>Even after deciding to quit Martel,</i>

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:48.000
<i>I took part in meetings with my parents.</i>

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:53.960
<i>The plan was to gradually fade out 
instead of leaving with a bang.</i>

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:55.990
<i>Not very brave, I know.</i>

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:57.110
<i>I'm a coward.</i>

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.480
Are you the Tennoujis' kid?

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:21.450
<i>Kashima Sakura, Martel's linchpin.</i>

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:26.750
<i>A luminary whom the more zealous members 
of the organization even called a saint.</i>

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:33.430
Your parents asked me to talk to you.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:35.570
About skipping meetings?

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:38.280
No. Just an informal chat.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.240
Let's see...

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:41.010
Are you having fun at school?

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.120
School?

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:46.200
<i>She hit me with a barrage 
of trivial questions.</i>

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:49.680
<i>But she peppered them 
with some curious words.</i>

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:51.010
<i>Night.</i>

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:51.920
<i>Forest.</i>

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:52.770
<i>Monster.</i>

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.690
<i>Hunt.</i>

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:54.900
<i>Superpowers.</i>

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:57.900
<i>She seemed to be sounding me out.</i>

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:02.280
I get the gist of it now.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.950
You're at an age where you have 
a lot on your mind, huh, Kotarou?

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:05.740
Right...

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:10.300
One last question.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:15.090
What do you usually do when you encounter 
something you find unacceptable?

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:16.380
What do you mean?

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:21.880
Do you strive to change 
yourself or your environment?

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:24.170
Or something else, perhaps?

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:25.890
I...

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.310
Dunno

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.310
Go with the flow

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.310
Give Up

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.310
Improve my environment

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.310
Change myself

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:28.350
Dunno

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:34.400
I don't know. I've never thought about it.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.060
I see.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.920
You must be a stray.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.260
Thank you!

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:48.410
Today's chocolate tart was amazing.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:49.410
Yes.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:54.040
It was as good as the one I once 
had at the Creme Chantilly.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:58.110
I guess we've covered pretty much all 
of the famous pâtisseries in town now.

00:03:58.110 --> 00:03:58.920
Indeed.

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:03.880
Uh, Esaka-san.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:08.850
Thank you for always hanging 
out with me like this.

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:10.420
Tennouji-kun.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:11.140
Yes?

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:15.460
A friendship free of any vested interests 
is a rare and valuable thing.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:18.330
Yeah, ones born out of self-interest 
feel awfully hollow.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:18.980
Yes.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:23.570
Today might mark the end of 
this relationship, though.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:27.070
I'd like to talk to you about something.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.400
Would you hear me out?

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:40.780
Tennouji-kun, I want to recruit you.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.220
You ought to join our organization.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.840
As a superhuman, you belong with us.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:47.170
<i>"Superhuman."</i>

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:49.360
<i>That's what he said.</i>

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:51.770
<i>People with abilities like mine.</i>

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.020
<i>Esaka-san was one of them,</i>

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:57.240
<i>and he was part of an organization 
that fought monsters.</i>

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:01.650
<i>What I saw in the forest 
that night was actually real.</i>

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:07.080
<i>All of my monster hunting 
suddenly felt childish.</i>

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:08.660
<i>I was embarrassed of myself.</i>

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:11.770
Earth-Saving Hunter, my ass.

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:16.120
<i>That night, I had an 
argument with my parents.</i>

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:20.630
<i>I told them I wanted to 
leave Martel for real.</i>

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.380
<i>We yelled at each other until late at night,</i>

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:26.630
<i>and my thoughts eventually came to a head.</i>

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.190
<i>Or came together, I should say.</i>

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:33.770
<i>It's me.</i>

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:36.610
I want to leave home.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:39.100
<i>If you're running away like a child, 
you'll get no help from me.</i>

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:42.620
<i>But if you're leaving as a man, I accept.</i>

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:43.400
Yeah.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:45.260
<i>You'd best be prepared.</i>

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:46.870
<i>This is where the going gets tough.</i>

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.660
<i>What followed was a period 
of upheaval in my life.</i>

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.300
Hey, morning.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:06.620
Good morning.

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:08.690
Uh, going on a family trip?

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:09.680
That's right.

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:12.550
<i>Kotori had been left 
scarred by Pero's death.</i>

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:16.060
<i>They must be doing this to lift her spirits.</i>

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.520
Talk to them like normal

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.520
Ignore them

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.520
Wait and watch

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.520
Send them off

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.520
Stop them

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:18.560
Stop them

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:22.060
<i>For some reason, I got the 
feeling I should stop them.</i>

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:26.190
Um, do you really have to go today?

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:28.450
Why do you ask?

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:31.200
I don't know...

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:32.820
<i>Why, indeed?</i>

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.080
What?

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:42.240
I learned a lot from how you live your life.

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:44.330
I wanted to thank you for that.

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.630
Where's this coming from?

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:47.320
That's all.

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:47.840
Later.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:48.710
Wait!

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:50.470
Where are you going?

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:52.910
Soccerbat practice.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.290
It's a new sport where 
we play soccer with bats.

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.470
Lies.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:59.230
Will you come back?

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:01.150
<i>Damn, she's sharp.</i>

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:04.710
I decided to quit Martel, too.

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:09.080
But my parents wouldn't stand for it, 
so I'm running away to a relative's place.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:10.150
Oh.

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.520
Harvest Festa...

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:16.210
They hold a "Harvest 
Festa" thing here, right?

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:16.870
Yeah.

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:19.500
Show me around.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.130
Why me?

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:25.010
I don't have any friends, 
so you show me around.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:27.230
I don't quite understand that logic.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:28.270
Just do it!

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.870
Talk about pushy...

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:31.260
Fine.

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.770
I'll show you around once I'm back.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:35.890
It's a promise, okay?

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:38.010
Hope to die, stick a needle in your eye.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.200
Bye.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:42.730
Say hi to your parents for us.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:43.520
I will.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:46.640
<i>I make a friend just as I'm leaving.</i>

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:49.650
<i>How ironic, really.</i>

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:56.410
<i>We cross a few mountains 
and end up in a town,</i>

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:59.410
<i>where there was an organization 
with no official name.</i>

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.170
<i>But everyone called it so:</i>

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:04.620
<i>"Guardian."</i>

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.400
Is this the stench of sewage?

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.420
Reality stinks.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:15.060
Living as you did, in the highest stratum 
of society, you tend to forget that.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:18.150
Tennouji, you've left Kazamatsuri behind now.

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.300
Never forget that.

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.310
Got it.

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.740
This is as far as I can take you.

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:26.100
Go on in. I've told them you're coming.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:27.420
You're not coming?

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:30.960
Do you want to be a soldier who 
needs his hand held all the time?

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:32.190
No.

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:35.570
Get some basic training 
and become half a man.

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:38.330
Right now, you're not even that.

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:41.370
Excuse me...

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:44.510
Nobody home, huh?

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.290
Hey.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:50.940
Wait...

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.000
There you are.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:56.970
Come this way.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:58.430
O-Okay.

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:11.610
<i>People who couldn't live a decent life 
because of their special abilities...</i>

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.480
<i>And I'm one of them.</i>

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.240
<i>But, man...</i>

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:21.490
<i>These guys are all crazy strong.</i>

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:23.650
<i>Guess I should go with that.</i>

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:27.210
<i>If I hit the pedal, I can 
step it up as much as I want.</i>

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.130
<i>I just need to wish for it, and it'll happen.</i>

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:31.880
<i>I've never needed any training at all.</i>

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.810
Which middle school are you from?

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:34.510
<i>Nah, I should wait and see.</i>

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:35.030
Second.

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:37.510
Second? My friend goes there!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.200
<i>That guy...</i>

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.230
For real?

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:39.360
For real!

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.160
<i>Don't I know him from middle school</i>

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:41.110
Gather round!

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:46.140
Due to its nature, there are strict 
restrictions on info about our organization.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:49.840
In this facility, you will 
undergo physical training,

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:53.470
and at the same time, strive to obtain 
special skills in the art of hunting.

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:55.470
Training will be harsh.

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.720
In the worst-case scenario, 
some of you might die.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:58.910
Stay focused at all times.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:02.240
You all have outstanding powers.

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:05.150
Maybe you had to keep them 
hidden in normal society,

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:07.360
but you can show them off 
to their fullest here.

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:11.780
Learn how to use them in a 
manner befitting superhumans.

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:14.250
Any questions?

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:14.920
Yes.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:17.420
You're... Tennouji?

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.170
Esaka-san recommended you, didn't he?

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:24.430
Uh, what exactly do we do here?

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.510
Put simply,

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:30.210
we eliminate monsters and keep their 
existence a secret from society.

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:30.940
I suppose

00:10:31.510 --> 00:10:35.980
you can consider it similar to 
what you used to do in the forest.

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:37.950
<i>So they did know about it.</i>

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:42.300
Isn't he...

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.000
<i>And so, we began training.</i>

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:51.750
<i>We spent the first two weeks marching.</i>

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:54.410
<i>Then came the core workouts,</i>

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:55.750
<i>practical exercises,</i>

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.760
<i>and theoretical lessons.</i>

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:02.010
<i>The monsters class was the most interesting.</i>

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:06.540
<i>I learned that every 
monster has a summoner...</i>

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:09.270
<i>People who create and use monsters.</i>

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.630
<i>As a group, they were referred to as "Gaia,"</i>

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:14.780
<i>and they were at odds with Guardian.</i>

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:17.780
<i>Gaia... People who used monsters.</i>

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:22.530
<i>In the end, this was a clash 
of people, of ideologies.</i>

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.800
<i>Sounds awfully complicated to me.</i>

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.790
Hey there, Great Hero.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.290
Imamiya?

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:30.200
What's with the hero stuff?

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:32.840
Well, you have real combat experience.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:34.580
I gotta respect you.

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:37.800
Though it's a bit weird that you 
were hunting monsters in secret.

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:39.990
What do you want?

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:44.350
It may not last long, but it seems 
we're teammates starting today.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.310
I expect great things from you.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:50.560
Even Mikuni, the freak elite, 
has got his eye on you.

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:54.560
Just so you know, I'm not that strong.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.780
Come on, don't be so modest.

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:59.290
Didn't <i>the</i> Esaka-san recommend you?

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.810
I shoulda been friends 
with you in middle school.

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:03.750
We met in passing a bunch of times, right?

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.020
Did we?

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:07.250
Anyway, let's do this, partner.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:07.830
Okay.

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:10.400
Want me to buy you something to drink?

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:12.580
<i>They put me on a pedestal, like so, but...</i>

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:16.960
I will now announce the results 
of the recent practical exam.

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:18.490
First, Mikuni.

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:21.290
Second, Kurokawa.

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:21.960
Third...

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:26.020
<i>In the very first exam, 
I ranked 22nd out of 22.</i>

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:27.470
<i>I was a total scrub,</i>

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.850
<i>and my reputation tanked immediately.</i>

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:31.780
21st, Nagai.

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:34.100
Last place, Tennouji.

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:36.180
Wh... Wh-Wha...

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:42.310
Hey there, Great Liar.

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:43.870
Where's my dummy knife?

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:45.740
Get it yourself.

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:49.270
Huh? You're way too useless, man.

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:53.710
If you've got no ability, shouldn't 
you find other ways to contribute?

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.750
You hear me?

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.250
Ow!

00:12:57.680 --> 00:12:59.880
What was that for, Nishikujou?

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.260
Aren't you ranked sixth from 
the bottom yourself?

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:05.290
Hey, I am technically the best on the team.

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:06.640
The best on the worst team.

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:08.740
<i>Nishikujou Touka.</i>

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.790
<i>Another of my teammates.</i>

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.520
Quit picking meaningless fights.

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:15.080
Okay, okay.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:16.280
Let's go, Nagai.

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:17.700
O-Okay.

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.020
<i>And there's Nagai.</i>

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:22.280
<i>The last of my teammates.</i>

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:27.160
Sorry. I've really done it now.

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:29.690
<i>I think his name was Mikuni.</i>

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:31.660
<i>An elite at the top of the class.</i>

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.160
He did that with his bare hands?

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:41.950
I hear Esaka-san brought you here?

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.170
That's amazing.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.990
Sorry, you'll have to explain.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.610
Esaka Sougen,

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:52.060
a veteran hero everyone in this trade knows.

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:56.840
Looking at your grades, I just don't get it.

00:13:56.840 --> 00:14:00.700
Why did Esaka-san recruit someone like you?

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.820
Was there a special reason of some sort?

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.440
Even if there was,

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.860
what business is it of yours?

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:09.700
Do you think I'm too much 
of a scrub to be here?

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:10.700
Of course not.

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:13.560
Well, scrubs have to be 
more wary than others.

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:16.570
So you're saying there is a reason?

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:18.960
You try too hard to read between the lines.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:22.200
You're giving yourself away.

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:24.550
Coaxing information out 
of people is beyond you.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.960
Also, it looks like being a condescending 
ass is second nature to you.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:29.940
Them's fighting words.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.620
You're nothing but small fry.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.350
<i>No argument here.</i>

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:45.240
<i>I was small fry who couldn't even 
beat girls in combat training.</i>

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:58.080
So you're a slasher.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.140
Busted, huh?

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:03.750
<i>Superhuman abilities are broadly 
classified into three types:</i>

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:06.300
Poaching-Type

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:06.300
<i>Poaching-types that specialize in hunting,</i>

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.050
Slashing-Type

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:09.050
<i>slashing-types that specialize in cutting,</i>

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:12.800
Tainting-Type

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:12.800
<i>and tainting-types that can control 
the body's circulatory organs.</i>

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:16.610
<i>By the way, I have the tainting-type 
ability to control blood.</i>

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.560
Oh, yeah. You never were 
good at shooting, Nagai.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:21.660
You wouldn't be a poacher.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.670
Hey, please don't tell anyone.

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:25.060
I won't.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.190
I have no one to tell.

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:27.430
I'm sorry.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:31.510
I'd end up in last place if I lost to you.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:33.950
Completely hopeless.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.580
You're like an open book.

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:37.330
Seriously, man...

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.990
You've got no power or speed,

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:42.060
so at least use your brain.

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:42.710
Damn it.

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:45.490
<i>Maybe I really should use it...</i>

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:47.770
<i>The power that gives me 
whatever power I want.</i>

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:49.670
<i>Hang on.</i>

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:53.470
<i>If controlling body fluids 
is my special ability,</i>

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.600
<i>then what is that thing?</i>

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:59.220
<i>That power to enhance my 
physical abilities as I please.</i>

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:02.350
<i>I guess you could call it 
the power to rewrite myself.</i>

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.860
<i>The power that'd make me 
as strong as I wished...</i>

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:07.690
<i>Something's off.</i>

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:09.560
<i>It's way too convenient.</i>

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.590
<i>If I rewrite my abilities enough,</i>

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:13.510
<i>then forget Imamiya and Nishikujou,</i>

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:15.120
<i>I could be far better than Mikuni, too.</i>

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:18.580
<i>How does that power work? What are its costs?</i>

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:20.690
<i>It feels dangerous.</i>

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.220
<i>I probably shouldn't use it too often.</i>

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.040
Esaka-san.

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:32.720
Tennouji?

00:16:33.140 --> 00:16:34.330
How are you doing?

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:35.530
Not too good.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:37.220
What are you saying, you idiot?

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:40.640
I feel like I'm letting you down.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.740
Did you see my grades?

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:46.750
Yeah, but your rank at the moment 
doesn't matter in the least.

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:50.530
We're not looking for people with good 
grades, but those who'll be useful.

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.740
Useful?

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:53.860
Let me train you a little.

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:56.040
You probably shouldn't be so partial to me.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:56.990
Why is that?

00:16:57.420 --> 00:17:00.030
It looks like you're pretty popular.

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:02.000
If someone like me kept you all to myself...

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.750
Quit putting yourself down.

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:07.500
You'll become a bottom feeder down there.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.500
I'm sorry.

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:11.630
It seems I need to retrain 
you from the ground up.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:18.010
Your bleeding has stopped.

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:20.760
Well, that's my ability.

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:22.350
You're honest.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.690
I don't mind if you know about it.

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:26.020
Honest to a fault.

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.040
I won't attack.

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:29.270
Come at me.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:51.420
That's all, huh?

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:54.420
Ten bouts, and I lost all of them...

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:56.990
Only when you go all-out

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:59.930
and hit your absolute limit 
will your skills improve.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:04.930
Do you want to go one last time?

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:10.190
I... do...

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:12.190
Good.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:21.780
From the left

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:21.780
Take a step back

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:21.780
Jump

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:21.780
From the right

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:21.780
Go head-on

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:22.830
From the right

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:27.370
Successive attacks at vitals

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:27.370
Use feints and see what he does

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:27.370
Look for an opening and surprise him

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:27.370
Go stealth and stake it all on one big attack

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:27.370
Invite an attack and counter him

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.080
Go stealth and stake it all on one big attack

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:36.940
Tennouji.

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:38.540
Yes?

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:42.650
Something felt different 
in that last move of yours.

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:45.600
I racked my brain to come up with that plan.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:47.160
Did you use your ability?

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:48.850
No. Not at all.

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:51.190
I see. A coincidence, then?

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.820
It felt really nasty.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.460
Was my attack a good one?

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:58.060
No, it was trash.

00:18:59.270 --> 00:19:01.960
Keep your attacks simple and bold.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.920
Don't turn everything into a 
gamble or a psychological battle.

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:09.770
Simple but effective use of power is the 
basis of combat and the secret to success.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:10.830
Got it.

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:13.120
Let's call it a day.

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:17.630
<i>I read up on Esaka-san.</i>

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:23.400
<i>The Bayern Knights of the Green Sword 
are the strongest group in Guardian.</i>

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:27.640
<i>They're the ones who saved me 
in the forest that one time.</i>

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:30.070
<i>And Esaka-san is their leader.</i>

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:35.520
<i>I focused on training during the day 
and read instructional books at night.</i>

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:39.590
<i>I'd never been so serious 
about anything before.</i>

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.620
<i>And, four weeks later,</i>

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:43.760
<i>me and my teammates</i>

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:48.160
<i>were ready for the last stage in 
basic training, the mock battle.</i>

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:50.740
Taking on lion dancers 
should be a piece of cake.

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:52.890
They're basically giving us a handicap.

00:19:57.150 --> 00:19:59.390
Are you kidding me?

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:01.680
That team only went in three minutes ago...

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:05.300
Team Imamiya, you're next. Bring it.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:08.260
Listen, you'll die if you don't focus.

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:09.310
Be careful!

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:10.930
We gotta do this.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:13.190
I'm seriously counting on you guys!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.230
Man, this pisses me off.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:19.220
Nobody can beat them.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.960
<i>Am I really superhuman?</i>

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:27.700
Oh, Mikunicchi.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.190
Way to go.

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:31.460
Human elite really are a cut above.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:34.960
Two lions? They beat four instructors?

00:20:35.180 --> 00:20:37.210
<i>In </i>The Tortoise and the Hare<i>,</i>

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:41.710
<i>if the hare hadn't slacked off, the 
tortoise would've never caught up.</i>

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:45.820
<i>And the world was full of 
hares that didn't slack.</i>

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.190
Congrats!

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:50.980
Grats!

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:53.100
<i>On the last day of basic training,</i>

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:55.730
<i>a small party was thrown for us.</i>

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:57.350
Listen up, rookies.

00:20:57.350 --> 00:21:01.490
Your job is to run around on the job 
and cause trouble for everyone.

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.610
Oh, please. I shine when it's for real.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:07.490
Stop hitting on me. This is not the time.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:11.340
What's wrong, Tennouji?

00:21:11.890 --> 00:21:14.010
You should be celebrating, 
but you seem gloomy.

00:21:14.010 --> 00:21:15.040
Esaka-san.

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:20.130
I've learned a lot here, but I 
don't think I've improved much.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:21.760
You're awfully negative.

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:24.760
But it might be better than being conceited.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:27.590
I got a little better,

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:30.100
but the others have shown 
much more improvement.

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:32.180
Listen, Tennouji.

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:34.850
There are many ways to live and prove useful.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.730
If everyone were a "hero" like Mikuni,

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.360
the organization would crumble.

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:43.240
Even at your current ability, 
you can be a fine soldier.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:44.710
You've got the right stuff.

00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:45.840
Thanks.

00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:49.760
We'll be carrying out a major 
operation in Kazamatsuri soon.

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:53.750
I'm sure a lot of people from this facility 
will be asked to take part in it.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:56.120
In Kazamatsuri?

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:59.910
That town has long been important to Gaia.

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:01.930
Esaka-san.

00:22:05.060 --> 00:22:07.080
By the way, Esaka-san...

00:22:07.370 --> 00:22:09.390
I don't see Nagai around.

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:11.260
She quit.

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:15.450
It seems she felt she'd hit her limit.

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:16.880
She did?

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:21.020
Many superhumans don't 
take setbacks too well.

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:24.530
I hope you don't break.
